# The prize board (projects/prizes): a systemd service on the machine itself (prizes.service, port 8047), not a
# container, listening only on the gateway address of the `proxy` network, like Kutsu. No `encode`: the page holds
# one /api/state request open for up to 25 s, and its small JSON answers gain nothing from compression.
prizes.{$BASE_DOMAIN} {
	import cache
	import access
	reverse_proxy 172.19.0.1:8047
}
